WEBVTT

00:01:47.890 --> 00:01:50.210
This is Eve's blood...

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:57.760
You're so fortunate... to have such blood...

00:02:06.150 --> 00:02:07.160
Eve...

00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:13.520
Hey, sow!

00:02:16.830 --> 00:02:19.450
Shut up! Don't yell in the bathroom!

00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:21.700
The echo is so loud!

00:02:22.030 --> 00:02:24.200
Y-Yeah, but... You suddenly...

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:26.480
Yuma-kun, why are you here?

00:02:27.150 --> 00:02:30.120
Because I need to see you, why else?

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:32.940
Come with me, right now!

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:35.880
Wait... No!

00:02:35.880 --> 00:02:38.890
What? Did you say no?

00:02:38.890 --> 00:02:41.350
I'll come out after I put my clothes on!

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:45.890
No one's going to get aroused 
by the sight of your body.

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:50.270
That's not the point!

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:02.360
Amazing.

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:06.040
All right, they're ready to be picked.

00:03:07.540 --> 00:03:09.460
Um, is this...

00:03:09.940 --> 00:03:11.460
My garden.

00:03:13.610 --> 00:03:15.600
Come on, help me out.

00:03:28.510 --> 00:03:29.850
Looks good.

00:03:35.880 --> 00:03:37.410
They look delicious.

00:03:37.410 --> 00:03:41.530
Of course they are. I grew them.

00:03:44.460 --> 00:03:46.860
Why are you growing vegetables?

00:03:46.860 --> 00:03:53.830
Because if we ever get stuck without food, 
we can live off these for a while.

00:03:53.830 --> 00:03:57.590
But I thought vampires could 
survive without eating.

00:03:57.590 --> 00:04:01.340
Well, yeah. We won't die from starvation.

00:04:01.780 --> 00:04:04.530
But I like eating food.

00:04:04.530 --> 00:04:06.760
I don't mind growing them, either.

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:09.090
We were originally humans, after all.

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:12.930
You were a human?

00:04:12.930 --> 00:04:15.960
Yeah, all of us brothers were.

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:20.250
I see...

00:04:21.580 --> 00:04:23.860
These aren't ready yet.

00:04:24.160 --> 00:04:25.690
You're picking them anyway?

00:04:25.690 --> 00:04:29.120
If you don't take out the bad sprouts, 
the fruits won't grow big.

00:04:29.780 --> 00:04:31.370
Just like humans.

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:36.120
Come on, get moving.

00:04:36.120 --> 00:04:37.360
R-Right...

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:42.580
But isn't it hard work to grow all this?

00:04:42.580 --> 00:04:45.180
What's the use in growing just a few at a time?

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:48.880
It's not like eating one or two would fill us up.

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:53.830
Though, back when I was roaming in the slums,

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:56.310
I would've happily wolfed down a single tomato.

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:58.010
The slums?

00:04:58.010 --> 00:05:01.730
I used to live in the slums before 
I met Ruki and the others.

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:05.700
It's not exactly a happy memory.

00:05:09.000 --> 00:05:12.370
My friends at the time were killed, after all.

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:23.230
And... if I hadn't met him, I would've been...

00:05:24.110 --> 00:05:25.670
Him?

00:05:29.570 --> 00:05:31.640
Don't ask me questions!

00:05:35.260 --> 00:05:36.020
It's good...

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:38.620
Right?

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:42.820
Yuma-kun?!

00:06:08.530 --> 00:06:10.230
You're not getting away.

00:06:18.340 --> 00:06:19.680
Let me go!

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:32.610
Delicious...

00:06:38.010 --> 00:06:40.830
Come on, give me more....

00:07:07.820 --> 00:07:10.370
<i>Where am I?</i>

00:07:20.700 --> 00:07:24.420
<i>Am I going to die here?</i>

00:07:30.850 --> 00:07:33.450
Yo. What happened to your back?

00:07:36.010 --> 00:07:37.430
Are you alone?

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:52.980
Don't worry, they're with me.

00:07:55.470 --> 00:07:56.150
Here.

00:08:02.350 --> 00:08:03.890
Come with us.

00:08:43.720 --> 00:08:45.490
Finally, you're awake.

00:08:46.860 --> 00:08:48.890
Yuma-kun...

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:58.670
You're hopeless.

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:18.310
There. Eat some of that.

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:22.120
I'm sharing something really valuable to me.

00:09:22.440 --> 00:09:24.770
You'd better savor it.

00:09:37.310 --> 00:09:38.890
It's sweet.

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:08.390
Beautiful.

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:38.860
Well, Yuma?

00:10:42.570 --> 00:10:45.140
Any sign of the awakening?

00:10:45.140 --> 00:10:47.410
Nope, none.

00:10:48.550 --> 00:10:51.920
Maybe it's not enough...

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:53.040
Yeah.

00:10:54.640 --> 00:10:57.050
The Apple of Adam plan....

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:05.100
We must accomplish the plan 
for him, whatever it takes.

00:11:12.590 --> 00:11:13.690
At any cost.

00:12:18.570 --> 00:12:21.220
Remove those standing in your way.

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:23.260
It's necessary in order to survive, isn't it?

00:12:24.260 --> 00:12:27.130
From that day on, everything changed...

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:30.450
Fulfill me with your blood.

00:12:30.450 --> 00:12:31.860
Prepare yourself.

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:36.900
Hey, sow! Hurry up and become my plaything.
